hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"76","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Sayyidah Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab apni namaz se salam pherte to Aap ke salam pherne par aurten khadi ho jatin aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni jagah thodi der baithe rehte. Ibn Shihab [Zuhri Rahimahullah] kehte hain: To hamara khayal hai ke Aap ka woh thaharna, wallahu a'lam, is liye tha taake qaum mein se wapas jane wale [mardon] ke un tak pahunchne se pehle aurten nikal jaen."
